     7816       if ArtDis
     7817         then
     7818       DISABLE goods.artic with frame d-gds-form.
     7819         else
     7820       ENABLE goods.artic with frame d-gds-form.
     7821       ENABLE
     7822       goods.okdp clients.obj-type clients.obj-code r-prod b-altbc
