     8920           find first tt0-fbr-gds-obj where
     8921                       tt0-fbr-gds-obj.obj-type = p-obj-type
     8922                   AND tt0-fbr-gds-obj.obj-code = p-obj-code no-error.
     8923           if not available tt0-fbr-gds-obj then do:
