    10634                 AND tt0-gds-obj-attr.attr-code = locked_gds-obj-attr.attr-code NO-ERROR.
    10635             IF NOT AVAILABLE tt0-gds-obj-attr THEN DO:
    10636               assign
    10637               v-deleted = yes.
