    10755                     tt0-gds-host-attr.gds-code = locked_gds-host-attr.gds-code
    10756                 AND tt0-gds-host-attr.host-code = locked_gds-host-attr.host-code
    10757                 AND tt0-gds-host-attr.attr-code = locked_gds-host-attr.attr-code NO-ERROR.
    10758             IF NOT AVAILABLE tt0-gds-host-attr THEN DO:
