    10767       v-created = no.
    10768       v-deleted = no.
    10769       v-updated = no.
    10770       if v-update-attr-gbl then do:
    10771         v-loc-update = no.
    10772         for each tt0-goods-attr NO-LOCK where
    10773                 tt0-goods-attr.gds-code = goods.gds-code:
