    10836             AND   locked_s-coeff.host-code = tt0-s-coeff.host-code
    10837             AND   locked_s-coeff.obj-type = tt0-s-coeff.obj-type
    10838             AND   locked_s-coeff.obj-code = tt0-s-coeff.obj-code
    10839             AND   locked_s-coeff.s-date   = tt0-s-coeff.s-date no-error.
    10840           assign
    10841           v-updated = no.
    10842           if available  locked_s-coeff then do:
