    10873         END.
    10874         v-update-s-coeff = v-loc-update.
    10875       end.
    10876       if v-update-gds-prop then do:
    10877         find first tt0-gds-obj-prop no-error.
    10878         if available locked_gds-obj-prop
    10879         and available tt0-gds-obj-prop
    10880         then do:
    10881           v-updated-str = "":U.
    10882           buffer-compare locked_gds-obj-prop
    10883           to tt0-gds-obj-prop
    10884           case-sensitive
    10885           save result in v-updated-str.
