    10888         else do:
    10889           if available tt0-gds-obj-prop then
    10890           v-update-gds-prop = yes.
    10891         end.
    10892         if v-update-gds-prop = false then do:
    10893             find first ttf-gds-obj-prop no-error.
    10894             if available locked_gds-obj-prop
    10895             and available ttf-gds-obj-prop
    10896             then do:
    10897               v-updated-str = "":U.
    10898               buffer-compare locked_gds-obj-prop
    10899               to ttf-gds-obj-prop
    10900               case-sensitive
